# Task 6.14's own cases: rexxref's examples ("Numbers and Arithmetic" and the
# numeric built-in functions), the errors, LOSTDIGITS under NUMERIC FUZZ,
# and the rows of the rules Moritz ruled 2026-10-20. The case
# grammar is the one `spike` describes.

case name=rexxref-operator-1 digits=5
infix + | 12 | 7.00
